<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">15092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>For the first time, a government has admitted it keeps weapons in orbit.</s> <s>Air Force Secretary Troy Meink said the United States has placed what he called space control weapons above the earth, and the Outer Space Treaty of nineteen sixty-seven bans only weapons of mass destruction up there — a hole in the law exactly the shape of this announcement.</s> <s>Every nation that depends on satellites it doesn't own now lives under a precedent Beijing and Moscow can cite back.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Yemen's military says Saudi jets flew fifty-four sorties against five provinces in a single day, and spokesman Yahya Saree warned the strikes won't go unanswered.</s> <s>Nearly eighty thousand people have been displaced inside Yemen by this exchange, and the sortie count comes from the side flying the aircraft while the funerals go largely uncounted by anyone.</s> <s>Saree's claim that air defences turned jets back over Saada hasn't been independently confirmed, and neither side is publishing a casualty figure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Thirteen students from Gaza hold scholarships at Belgian universities, and Belgium won't help a single one of them reach Brussels.</s> <s>The country's own rectors called the delay a bargaining chip in migration politics rather than a security question, after one coalition party tied any evacuation to the building of new deportation centres.</s> <s>A scholarship's worthless without an exit permit, and the state that grants the admission isn't the state that controls the crossing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Austria revoked a visa it had already issued, so Iran's nuclear chief can't enter the room where the <sub alias="International Atomic Energy Agency">IAEA</sub>'s members meet once a year in Vienna.</s> <s>Washington objected to a Security Council exemption, and under the sanctions committee's no-objection rule that single objection was enough for the host state to shut the door.</s> <s>Russia's protested, and the dispute's now about who controls access to multilateral institutions rather than about centrifuges at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Kyiv, prosecutor general Ruslan Kravchenko signed charges against the head of the very bureau built to investigate his own office.</s> <s>Ukraine's anti-corruption bureau and its specialised prosecutors were created as conditions on Western loans, deliberately placed outside the prosecutor general's chain of command.</s> <s>A notice of suspicion is the one lever that reaches them anyway, and whether the watchdogs survive it is now an open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Finland has moved under France's nuclear umbrella, bringing to eleven the number of European states sheltering there.</s> <s>For seventy years extended deterrence in Europe meant American warheads shared through NATO's planning group... but France's president alone decides the use of roughly two hundred and ninety French weapons.</s> <s>Helsinki sits on a border with Russia over thirteen hundred kilometres long, and Estonia's premier says his government's weighing the same step.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Irish police found cocaine soaked into plywood sawdust, part of a shift that's turning the drug into a liquid.</s> <s>Traffickers dissolve the crystalline salt into shampoo, resin, fuel or wine, move it through ordinary commercial shipping, then reconstitute it at destination labs — and scanners and dogs calibrated for powder can't see it.</s> <s>European states dismantled forty-two extraction labs last year, while the enforcement pressure and the violence stay in the Andes.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Stockholm, the count stands at one hundred and seventy-six seats to one hundred and seventy-three, and neither bloc can reach the one hundred and seventy-five it needs.</s> <s>Losses by the far-right Sweden Democrats stripped the Swedish right of its governing partner for the first time since twenty twenty-two.</s> <s>Final results arrive Wednesday, and parliament then has to find a government inside the arithmetic it's been handed.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China and India cut liquefied natural gas imports to multi-year lows and burned coal and oil instead, because Qatari and Emirati cargoes can't clear the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>Asian spot prices sit near thirty dollars per million <sub alias="British thermal units">BTU</sub>, up from about ten before the war, and gas is discretionary for both countries — so they simply switched.</s> <s>The climate cost of a Gulf conflict has landed on Asian cities that had no part in it, and nobody's attributing it to the war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Islamabad, diesel rose six rupees and ten paisa to four hundred and nine rupees a litre.</s> <s>One hundred and fourteen rupees of every litre is tax, a fixed commitment under Pakistan's <sub alias="I M F">IMF</sub> programme, which means the state absorbs none of Brent crude's twenty-two percent weekly rise.</s> <s>Diesel moves freight and runs tube wells, so this reaches food prices within weeks.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A walking humanoid robot out of Hangzhou now costs thirteen thousand five hundred dollars, where Western makers price comparable machines above one hundred thousand.</s> <s>Founder Wang Xingxing got there by building the actuators and motors in-house rather than buying precision parts from established suppliers — the same vertical-integration move that reset solar panels and lithium cells.</s> <s>Whether the price holds as volumes rise will decide who builds the world's robots, God willing we find out soon.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The ten-year Treasury yield touched five percent in New York.</s> <s>August inflation ran three point four percent annualised against the Federal Reserve's two percent target, and that yield sets the floor under mortgage rates in Ohio and borrowing costs in Nairobi alike.</s> <s>The Fed meets Tuesday and Wednesday, with no good option on the table.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At a cement plant in Chakwal, solar now supplies a quarter of Bestway's electricity.</s> <s>Pakistan's grid charges fixed capacity payments no matter how much power anyone buys, so when a large industrial user generates its own, the bill for those fixed costs falls on the households left behind.</s> <s>Each defection raises the tariff for the poorest customers, which pushes the next buyer toward the roof.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Nepal counts one thousand three hundred and ninety-six dead from the August landslide, and five thousand one hundred still missing.</s> <s>The missing outnumber the dead four to one, which tells you this is a search still digging rather than a toll close to final — the slide buried villages instead of scattering them.</s> <s>Crews are excavating monsoon-soaked, unstable slopes near the border, and the number will keep moving.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Off Surabaya, a ferry crossing the Java Sea toward Banjarmasin capsized with one hundred and twenty-nine people still missing and six confirmed dead.</s> <s>Three-metre waves struck the vessel side-on, and ferries remain the only affordable link between Indonesia's seventeen thousand islands for people who'll never board a plane.</s> <s>Rough seas are still blocking the rescue.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In London, researchers published the first prospective trial of black seed oil — eight adults, twenty days.</s> <s>Nigella sativa has been used as a remedy in hadith literature for fourteen centuries, and this is the first time it's been tested forward rather than claimed backward.</s> <s>They found no shift in the gut microbiome, but detected thymoquinone in urine, confirming the compound reaches circulation... and a placebo-controlled trial is the obvious next step.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At Tokyo Metropolitan University, scientists watched shiga toxin-producing <sub alias="E coli">E. coli</sub> spread without ever letting go of each other.</s> <s>The cells elongate and divide but don't separate, defying the assumption that bacteria detach and scatter — so one organism can found an entire chain that tests read as a single colony.</s> <s>These strains cause kidney failure in children, and the newly named gene family gives detection something to look for.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>President Trump called warnings about AI danger a sick conspiracy, rejecting appeals from Sam Altman, Elon Musk and Dario Amodei to slow down.</s> <s>His argument is that existing fraud and consumer-protection law already lets prosecutors reach AI harms — a claim that general statutes cover a technology whose damage mostly isn't fraud.</s> <s>Restraint's being framed as ceding ground to Beijing, which is precisely why no government expects to move first.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Oracle ended jobs with a pre-dawn email signed only Oracle Leadership, telling recipients today was their last working day.</s> <s>Access was revoked before the message landed, so no named executive had to deliver it — and for staff on H-1B status the note starts a sixty-day clock on legal residence, making an American layoff an immigration event in India.</s> <s>The company's spending tens of billions on AI datacentre capacity, converting headcount into <sub alias="G P Us">GPUs</sub>.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Apple shipped a rebuilt Siri in iOS twenty-seven, reaching more than a billion phones in what it calls the largest single-day rollout of a conversational AI.</s> <s>The assistant reads messages, photos and what's on screen, and the phone itself decides whether a query stays on the device, goes to Apple's private cloud, or is handed to Google's model.</s> <s>So on-device AI is a claim about a subset, and the user can't audit which subset they got.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In San Francisco, hundreds of contractors have been reading real ChatGPT conversations under a programme known internally as Project Lily.</s> <s>They read, summarise and rate responses in stages, which means the medical symptoms and confessions people type into a text box pass in front of a human being.</s> <s>OpenAI says personal details are stripped first, and users typing those words had no way to know.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Manhattan's district attorney seized twelve websites that used one thousand two hundred people's faces without consent.</s> <s>The seizure ran on a twenty twenty-three law written for counterfeit goods rather than synthetic imagery, and the office's reach stops at sites hosted from Manhattan.</s> <s>The same pipeline is aimed at private women and schoolchildren with no prosecutor anywhere behind them.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>